          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To compute the magnitude (length) of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\mathbf{a},]</span> we can use the Pythagorean theorem in three dimensions:</p>",
            "readable_text": "To compute the magnitude (length) of [MATH: \\mathbf{a},] we can use the Pythagorean theorem in three dimensions:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: a|= sqrt((2)^{2} + (\u2212 1)^{2} + (3)^{2}); = sqrt(4 + 1 + 9); = sqrt(14)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: a|= sqrt((2)^{2} + (\u2212 1)^{2} + (3)^{2}); = sqrt(4 + 1 + 9); = sqrt(14)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>In general, given a vector\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: [a_{x}; a_{y}; a_{z}]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "In general, given a vector\n[MATH: [a_{x}; a_{y}; a_{z}]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>the magnitude of the vector can always be computed as\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: |\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,| = \\sqrt{a_x^2+a_y^2+a_z^2}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "the magnitude of the vector can always be computed as\n[MATH: |\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,| = \\sqrt{a_x^2+a_y^2+a_z^2}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><strong>Note</strong></p>",
            "readable_text": "Note",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We sometimes use the notation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: || \\mathbf a ||]</span> to denote the magnitude of a vector. </p>",
            "readable_text": "We sometimes use the notation [MATH: || \\mathbf a ||] to denote the magnitude of a vector.",
            "images": [],
