            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Using the formula, we have \n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: |a||= sqrt(a_{x}^{2} + a_{y}^{2} + a_{z}^{2}); = sqrt(2^{2} + (\u2212 3)^{2} + (\u2212 7)^{2}); = sqrt(4 + 9 + 49); = sqrt(62).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Using the formula, we have\n[MATH: |a||= sqrt(a_{x}^{2} + a_{y}^{2} + a_{z}^{2}); = sqrt(2^{2} + (\u2212 3)^{2} + (\u2212 7)^{2}); = sqrt(4 + 9 + 49); = sqrt(62).]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
